      "result": "A word here, a raised eyebrow there. By Friday you know more than anyone, and people know it." } ] },
  { "event": "work_interview",
    "insights": [
      { "trait": "charming", "text": "The panel smiled at your first answer. That's half the job done." },
      { "trait": "introvert", "text": "The small talk before the interview is the hardest part." } ] },
  { "event": "work_ethics",
    "insights": [ { "trait": "paranoid", "text": "Your boss is standing very close to the shredder." }, { "trait": "dishonest", "text": "You could do this in your sleep. Nobody would ever know." } ] },
  { "event": "work_customer",
    "choices": [ { "trait": "hot_tempered", "text": "Tell him exactly what you think",
